BT 1 0 0 1 0 159 Tm /F1 9 Tf 12 TL (Seven foundational anomalies in early-universe cosmology -- the horizon problem, the flatness problem, the initial) Tj T* (conditions of inflation, the Hubble tension, the S8 tension, the past hypothesis, and baryon asymmetry -- have resisted) Tj T* (unified explanation within the standard Lambda-CDM framework. Each has generated its own cottage industry of solutions,) Tj T* (none of which connect to the others. This paper closes all seven using a single equation: the Wike Coherence Law, C = C0) Tj T* (x exp\(-alpha x gamma_eff\). The argument is structural. At t = 0, there is no decoherence. Therefore C = C0. This single fact) Tj T* (-- maximum coherence at the origin -- resolves the horizon problem \(causal contact is irrelevant when there is only one) Tj T* (state\), the flatness problem \(maximum coherence IS flat geometry\), and the past hypothesis \(maximum coherence IS) Tj T* (minimum entropy\). Inflation is recast as the first decoherence event: the coherent vacuum is a maximum, not a minimum,) Tj T* (and its decay provides the energy for exponential expansion without an ad hoc inflaton field. The Hubble and S8 tensions) Tj T* (are shown to be the same anomaly -- an evolving gamma_eff that shifts coherence state between the CMB epoch and the) Tj T* (present. Baryon asymmetry follows from differential coherence between matter and antimatter sectors, with the observed) Tj T* (baryon-to-photon ratio eta = 6.1 x 10^-10 recovered from alpha x gamma_c\(baryon\) = 21.2. No free parameters are) Tj T* (introduced. No fine-tuning is required. The universe started the only way a maximally coherent state can start, and) Tj T* (everything that followed is exponential decay.) Tj T* ET
